   "Rows: part 1: 6 years (昭和3-8年, 年末 printed small above the first year; 同 = printed ditto); part 2: 總數 + 8 州廳 rows (臺北, 新竹, 臺中, 臺南, 高雄, 臺東, 花蓮港, 澎湖) = 9 rows. Region names assembled from stacked left/right characters (臺北, 新竹, 臺中, 臺南 on the upper block; 高雄, 臺東, 花蓮港 (蓮 printed as middle character), 澎湖).",
   "Checks (python): in every row 總數 = sum of the five categories; the regions sum to the 總數 row in all six columns; 昭和8年 row equals the 地方別 總數 row."
